  "label": "Dog as Analogical Mapping",
  "description": "The use of a dog to represent or symbolize a human sentiment or attitude is an analogical mapping technique. In this meme, the innocent-looking Shiba Inu is used to contrast with the hateful message, attempting to distance the viewer from the racism. This technique is not visible in the image but is a key element of how the meme functions.",
